* Sun Oct 11 2026 Michal Kasik <MiPal666@users.noreply.github.com> - 0.2.0-1
- First unified Felis BT Battery Audio package.
- Bundle the tested oFono 0.1.4 battery provider backend in the GUI RPM.
- Replace the old fixed-delay registration with BlueZ/HFP readiness ordering.
- Obsolete the former standalone felisbtbattery-ofono-plugin package.
- Restart oFono on installation and final removal so the plugin is loaded/unloaded.
- Add custom Felis cat + Bluetooth application icon.
- Keep paired-device connect/disconnect control, NOTICE page and Czech translation.
- Keep generic multi-Battery1 GUI support; physical left/right/case and non-audio
  battery hardware remains unverified.

* Sat Oct 10 2026 Michal Kasik <MiPal666@users.noreply.github.com> - 0.1.2-1
- Rename the visible application to Felis BT Battery Audio.
- Keep paired Bluetooth devices visible when disconnected.
- Add tap-to-connect / tap-to-disconnect through BlueZ Device1.
- Add a prominent NOTICE page describing tested scope and limitations.
- Add Czech UI translation.
- Add generic support for multiple BlueZ Battery1 component objects when
  Device and Identifier properties are available; no battery values are
  estimated or combined.

* Mon Oct 05 2026 Michal Kasik <MiPal666@users.noreply.github.com> - 0.1.1-1
- Enable the Sailjail Bluetooth permission instead of disabling sandboxing.
- Keep direct BlueZ Device1/Battery1 monitoring over the system D-Bus.

